WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
Sister Yun Xi, what’s wrong with you?

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,960
Are you feeling unwell? Your face is so red.

3
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:05,080
No, maybe a little hot

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:06,800
Stop guessing

5
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,580
I died once

6
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:12,100
I was pushed to lose by my most trusted girlfriend

7
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:14,940
The house was occupied by them

8
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:16,240
too much

9
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:21,330
I want to help her too

10
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,050
Ke Lulu has a lightsaber

11
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:24,690
And I can't do anything

12
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:27,890
I can only take off my hind legs. This is

13
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:29,830
my business

14
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:32,860
me now

15
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:35,060
Already have the strength to punish them personally

16
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,460
I'll go meet them tonight

17
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:39,740
Late-night night markets can bring out the greatest advantage

18
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:42,180
Moreover, the incapacity is stronger at night

19
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,860
Just control them as helpers
